{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "header",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 奇异值分解与低秩近似\n\n先问分解是什么、为什么存在；再辨认奇异值和奇异向量怎样组织矩阵结构；最后用两种范数理解截断误差、唯一性和任务边界。\n\n**箭头表示直接的学习前提。**",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 5200,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "group-structure",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "1. 分解、方向与子空间",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 5200,
      "height": 1700,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-norms",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "2. 两种矩阵范数",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2040,
      "width": 5200,
      "height": 760,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "group-low-rank",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "3. 低秩近似与解释边界",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2860,
      "width": 5200,
      "height": 1180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "svd",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异值分解|Singular value decomposition]]\n\nFor an $m$-row, $n$-column matrix, $A=U\\Sigma V^*$: read input coordinates, apply nonnegative stretches, then reconstruct in an output basis.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n完整分解用两组正交或酉基连接输入与输出；$V^*$ 表示共轭转置。",
      "x": 2250,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "existence",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[SVD存在性|Why SVD always exists]]\n\nUse the orthonormal eigenbasis of $A^*A$, construct positive output directions, then complete the bases.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每个有限维实或复矩阵都存在 SVD，包括长方、奇异及不可对角化矩阵。",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "singular-value",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异值|Singular values]]\n\nNonnegative stretches along special input directions. For an $m\\times n$ matrix, list $p=\\min(m,n)$ values, including zeros.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n记录特定输入方向上的伸缩量；按较小维数列值，零值也计入列表。",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "singular-vector",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异向量|Singular vectors]]\n\nFor $\\sigma>0$, unit directions obey $Av=\\sigma u$ and $A^*u=\\sigma v$. Right vectors live in the input space; left vectors in the output space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正值把单位输入方向与单位输出方向配对；星号表示共轭转置。",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "singular-value-gram",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异值与Gram谱|Singular values and Gram spectra]]\n\nFor an $m\\times n$ matrix $A$ of rank $r$, $^*$ denotes conjugate transpose. $A^*A$ and $AA^*$ share positive eigenvalues $\\sigma_i^2$, including multiplicity. Their zero counts are $n-r$ and $m-r$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正谱相同不表示完整谱相同或两侧都可逆。通常奇异值列表只有 min(m,n) 项。",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "singular-vector-gram",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异向量与Gram特征向量|Constructing paired directions]]\n\nChoose unit $v$ with $A^*Av=\\lambda v$, $\\lambda>0$. Then $\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\lambda}$ and $u=Av/\\sigma$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n只对正值相除；不能独立选择两侧基后随意配对。零空间两侧分别补基。",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "svd-vs-eigen",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[SVD与特征分解|SVD and eigendecomposition]]\n\nEigenvectors stay on a line in one space. SVD pairs input and output directions, including rectangular maps.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**SVD 与特征分解**\n\n特征向量保持一条直线；SVD 配对输入、输出方向，也适用于长方矩阵。",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "hand-computation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[SVD手算流程|Computing an SVD by hand]]\n\nFind an orthonormal Gram eigenbasis, pair only positive stretches through $Av_i=\\sigma_i u_i$, then complete the null-space bases.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n零奇异值不能相除；核对两侧标准正交性和重建。手算 Gram 构造并非稳定数值实现的处方。",
      "x": 150,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "rank",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异值与秩|Rank from singular values]]\n\nExact rank counts strictly positive values. For rank $r$, input and output nullities are $n-r$ and $m-r$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正值数给精确秩；两侧零空间维数还取决于矩阵形状。阈值判秩另属数值口径。",
      "x": 1250,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "compact",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[紧SVD|Compact SVD]]\n\nFor rank $r$, the factors retain all $r$ positive values and reconstruct $A$ exactly. Economy size is instead $p=\\min(m,n)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n紧 SVD 保留全部正方向。秩亏时经济型可能多留零方向；再删正方向才改变矩阵。",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "four-subspaces",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[SVD与四个基本子空间|Four fundamental subspaces]]\n\nPositive right/left columns span $C(A^*)$ / $C(A)$. The remaining full-basis columns span $N(A)$ / $N(A^*)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n正方向张成输入侧行空间与输出侧列空间；其余完整基列分别张成右、左零空间。",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "paired-phase",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异向量共同相位|Common phase]]\n\nA simple positive singular value fixes each paired direction up to the same unit-modulus factor. Over the reals this is a simultaneous sign change.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n左右须同乘同一相位；只变一侧通常会改变矩阵。重值组有更大的换基自由。",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1610,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "rank-one-expansion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[SVD秩一展开|SVD as rank-one terms]]\n\n$A=\\sum_{i=1}^{r}\\sigma_i u_iv_i^*$: each term reads the coordinate $v_i^*x$, scales it, and sends it along $u_i$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n每个正值项是一次单方向传递；全部正项相加，精确重建原矩阵。",
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 1610,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "repeated-value",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[重奇异值下方向不唯一|Repeated positive values]]\n\nWithin one repeated positive block, replace $U_J,V_J$ by $U_JQ,V_JQ$ using the same unitary $Q$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n整组使用同一正交或酉换基，保留原矩阵与两侧子空间；不能任意混合不同奇异值。",
      "x": 4350,
      "y": 1290,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "zero-block",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[SVD零块补基不唯一|Independent nullspace bases]]\n\nChoose bases of $N(A)$ and $N(A^*)$ independently. Their dimensions $n-r$ and $m-r$ may differ; no positive stretch pairs them.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n零空间分别补基，可能一侧为空；不能把正值方向的共同换基要求套到零块。",
      "x": 3450,
      "y": 1610,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "spectral-norm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[谱范数|Spectral norm]]\n\n$\\|A\\|_2=\\max_{\\|x\\|_2=1}\\|Ax\\|_2$ measures the largest Euclidean stretch over input directions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在所有单位输入方向中，寻找最大的输出长度；可用于实或复矩形矩阵。",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 2120,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "spectral-identity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[谱范数与最大奇异值|Spectral norm and singular values]]\n\nFor a nonempty finite real or complex matrix, $\\|A\\|_2=\\sigma_1$. A leading right singular vector attains this stretch.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n最大奇异值就是最大伸缩；零矩阵时所有单位方向都达到零。",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "frobenius-norm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Frobenius范数|Frobenius norm]]\n\n$\\|A\\|_F=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i,j}|a_{ij}|^2}$ combines all entry magnitudes; its square is the total squared size.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n把各元素的模平方相加后开平方；平方和本身是范数的平方。",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 2120,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "frobenius-identity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Frobenius范数与奇异值|Frobenius norm and singular values]]\n\nFor $p=\\min(m,n)$, $\\|A\\|_F^2=\\sum_{i=1}^{p}\\sigma_i^2$. Taking the square root gives the norm.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n全部奇异值的平方和等于Frobenius范数的平方；允许零奇异值。",
      "x": 2900,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "low-rank",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[低秩近似]]\n\n先给定秩预算和误差度量，再在所有秩受限矩阵中寻找最接近原矩阵的候选。",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 2980,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "truncated-svd",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[截断SVD|Truncated SVD]]\n\nKeep the largest singular components. With rank $r$, retaining $0\\le k\\le r$ positive pieces gives rank $k$; keeping all $r$ recovers $A$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**截断 SVD**\n\n保留最大的奇异分量。保留 $0\\le k\\le r$ 个正分量时秩为 $k$；全部保留恢复原矩阵。",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 2980,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "eym",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[截断SVD最佳低秩近似|Best low-rank approximation]]\n\nFor $0\\le k<r$, rank-at-most-$k$ truncation minimizes both errors: spectral $\\sigma_{k+1}$; Frobenius $\\sqrt{\\sum_{i>k}\\sigma_i^2}$. For $k\\ge r$, only $A$ has zero error.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**最佳低秩近似**\n\n秩预算 $0\\le k<r$ 时，谱误差为 $\\sigma_{k+1}$，Frobenius 误差为尾部平方和的平方根；$k\\ge r$ 时唯一零误差解为 $A$。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 2980,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "frobenius-uniqueness",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[Frobenius低秩近似唯一性]]\n\n当 $1\\le k<\\operatorname{rank}(A)$ 时，Frobenius 最优解恰在 $\\sigma_k>\\sigma_{k+1}$ 时唯一。",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 2900,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spectral-nonuniqueness",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[谱范数低秩近似不唯一|Nonunique spectral minimizers]]\n\nFor $1\\le k<r$, reduce a retained amplitude by $0<\\delta\\le\\sigma_{k+1}$: the worst error stays $\\sigma_{k+1}$. A strict gap does not restore uniqueness. Budgets $k=0$ or $k\\ge r$ give a unique minimizer.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**谱范数最优解不唯一**\n\n非平凡预算下，改变保留幅度也可维持同一最大误差；严格间隔仍不唯一。$k=0$ 或 $k\\ge r$ 则唯一。",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 3180,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "energy-ratio",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异值能量比|Retained energy ratio]]\n\nFor $A\\ne0$, $E_k=1-\\|A-A_k\\|_F^2/\\|A\\|_F^2$. Relative norm error is $\\sqrt{1-E_k}$. For nonzero centred data, $E_k$ is the cumulative explained sample-variance ratio; at $A=0$ the ratio is undefined.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**奇异值能量比**\n\n度量保留的平方总量；相对范数误差是 $\\sqrt{1-E_k}$。中心化非零数据才直接对应样本解释方差比，零矩阵比例无定义。",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 3570,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "task-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[奇异值能量不等于任务信息|Energy and task information]]\n\nA four-point example retains $100/101$ of the energy but loses the only feature that predicts the target. Evaluate the actual task, with preprocessing fitted on training data.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n**能量与任务信息的区别**\n\n约99%的重构能量仍可丢掉关键预测特征。按实际目标验证；均值、尺度和奇异方向只在训练部分拟合。",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 3570,
      "width": 1300,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 阅读提示\n\n绿色表示概念入口；黄色表示计算方法；蓝色表示结构与恒等式；紫色表示定理；红色表示限制结论；橙色表示概念辨析。颜色不表示掌握程度。点击标题可打开对应笔记。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4100,
      "width": 5200,
      "height": 200
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
